Do not auto-publish content. Do not treat an AI recommendation as managerial approval.

Keep an auditable record of who made each decision, when it happened, which version they reviewed and what changed.

## 12. REVIEW HISTORY MUST SHOW REAL RECORDS

Remove the fake review count and fake history entries.

Build Review History from persisted submissions, findings, revisions and human decisions.

Provide useful filters for:
